OL,3,GNEWSAAward an 'immense honour' for
OL,4,Afootball club
OL,5,
OL,6,FWorthing Football Club has been granted
OL,7,Fthe Freedom of the Borough, the highest
OL,8,Fcivic honour awarded by Worthing
OL,9,FBorough Council.
OL,11,FCouncillors unanimously agreed to
OL,12,Fbestow the title on the club in
OL,13,Frecognition of its achievements on and
OL,14,Foff the pitch, including promotion to
OL,15,Fthe National League for the first time
OL,16,Fin its history.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
