OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAAward an 'immense honour' for
OL,4,Afootball club
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe award comes after a remarkable
OL,7,Fperiod for the Rebels, who reached the
OL,8,Ftop tier of non-league football more
OL,9,Fthan 140 years after the club was
OL,10,Ffounded and now compete among the
OL,11,Fcountry's leading semi-professional
OL,12,Fsides.
OL,14,FOwner George Dowell MBE said:
OL,15,F"Receiving the Freedom of the Borough
OL,16,Fis an immense honour for everyone
OL,17,Fconnected with Worthing Football Club."
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
